    "content": "<style type=\"text/css\">@media only screen {* { word-break: break-word; }}</style><style type=\"text/css\">@media screen and (max-width: 384px) { .mail-message-content { width: 414px !important; } }</style><style>@media only screen and (max-width:600px) {\n        .ck-padding-left-none {\n          padding-left: 0px !important;\n        }\n        .ck-padding-right-none {\n          padding-right: 0px !important;\n        }\n        .ck-padding-left-mobile-friendly {\n          padding-left: 18px !important;\n        }\n        .ck-padding-right-mobile-friendly {\n          padding-right: 18px !important;\n        }\n    }</style><style>@media only screen and (max-width:600px) {\n        .ck-mobile-font-size {\n          font-size: 50px !important;\n        }\n     }</style><style>@media only screen and (max-width:600px) {\n        .ck-mobile-font-size {\n          font-size: 50px !important;\n        }\n     }</style><table cellPadding=\"0\" cellSpacing=\"0\" bgcolor=\"#ffffff\" style=\"width:100%;margin:0 auto;background-color:#ffffff\"><tbody><tr><td><style>\n  .email {\n    background: #ffffff !important;\n  }\n</style><div class=\"ck-section\" style=\"margin:0px auto 40px auto\"><center><table cellPadding=\"0\" cellSpacing=\"0\" style=\"width:100%;margin:0 auto;max-width:640px\"><tbody><tr><td contenteditable=\"false\"></td><td width=\"640\" style=\"background-color:#ffffff;background-size:cover;background-position:center;box-sizing:border-box;mso-padding-alt:36px 36px 0px 36px\" bgcolor=\"#ffffff\"><div class=\"ck-inner-section ck-padding-left-mobile-friendly ck-padding-right-mobile-friendly\" style=\"padding:36px 36px 0px 36px\"><div style=\"margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;max-width:640px\"><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">Dear {{ subscriber.first_name }}</p><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">\u200b</p><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">Good morning!</p><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">\u200b</p><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">We&#x27;re just a day away from our exclusive webinar, &quot;Budgeting Brilliance: Best Practices for Financial Foresight,&quot; and we wanted to remind you to reserve your spot if you haven&#x27;t already. Join Paul Barnhurst and Ron Monteiro as they delve into invaluable insights designed to streamline your organization\u2019s budgeting process.</p><h3 style=\"font-family:Charter, Georgia, Times New Roman, serif;font-size:28px;color:#11363F;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-align:center;text-transform:none\" class=\"\"><strong>Event Details</strong></h3><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\"><strong>Title: </strong> Budgeting Brilliance: Best Practices for Financial Foresight,</p><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\"> </p><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\"><strong>Date:</strong> Monday, April 15th, 2024.</p><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">\u200b</p><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\"><strong>Facilitators</strong>: Paul Barnhurst (aka the FP&amp;A guy) and Ron Monteiro (aka the Storytelling guy)</p><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">\u200b</p><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\"><strong>Time: </strong>12-1 PM EST</p><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">\u200b</p><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-align:center;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">\u200b<a href=\"https://streamyard.com/watch/5sdWuP6MGaUh\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color:#0000ff\">Click here to Join the Webinar</a>\u200b</p><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">\u200b</p><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">In this session, you\u2019ll gain access to a set of 10 best practice tips directly from our acclaimed Best Practices FP&amp;A Course. These tips will enhance your budgeting strategies and ensure that your organization can handle the complexities of annual planning with unprecedented precision and foresight.</p><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">Here\u2019s what you can expect:</p><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">\u200b</p><ul class=\"unordered_list\" style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;list-style-position:inside\"><li class=\"list_item\"><span>Actionable insights from seasoned finance professionals.</span></li><li class=\"list_item\"><span>Practical advice to apply immediately within your own budgeting processes.</span></li><li class=\"list_item\"><span>A deeper understanding of how to navigate financial challenges effectively.</span></li></ul><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">\u200b</p><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">Don\u2019t miss this opportunity to elevate your financial acumen. Register now to secure your participation and transform your approach to budgeting!</p><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">\u200b</p><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-align:center;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">\u200b<a href=\"https://streamyard.com/watch/5sdWuP6MGaUh\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color:#0000ff\">Click here to Join the Webinar</a>\u200b</p><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">\u200b</p><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">Looking forward to seeing you there!</p><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">\u200b</p><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\"> Warm regards,<br/>\u200b<br/> Paul Barnhurst<br/> The FP&amp;A Guy<br/>\u200b<br/> Ron Monteiro<br/> The Storytelling guy</p></div></div></td><td contenteditable=\"false\"></td></tr></tbody></table><div><!--[if mso]><br /><br /><![endif]--></